- assuming modern individualism in collectivist / honor-shame settings;
- treating ancient family, patronage, slavery, kingship, and purity systems as identical to modern equivalents.

Preferred approach:

- First-century / ancient setting.
- Social and religious dynamics.
- Human motivation.
- Theological meaning.
- Careful modern application.

