Parallel bridge method:

1. Identify the core tension in the text.
2. Identify the core human issue beneath it.
3. Identify a modern context where the same issue appears.
4. Preserve differences between then and now.
5. Explain the bridge clearly.
6. Show the modern cost of the same heart issue.
