- women do not lead or authoritatively teach men in the mixed assembly;
- elders are qualified men;
- a preacher is not automatically a pastor;
- Christians must abstain from alcohol;
- marriage is one man and one woman for life;
- remarriage is permitted only under the restricted biblical ground stated above;
- same-sex conduct is sin and homosexual identity is not a holy created identity;
- current science does not prove genetic determinism or immutable orientation at birth;
- real repentance and change are possible, though not identical in every case;
